  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Promise 2025 (NDC 3.0 Revision)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brief DescriptionThe UNDP Climate Promise 2025 aims to support the UN systems coordinated efforts toward advancing NDC 3.0. The projects primary purpose is to assist the Government of Lao PDR in revising its NDC with a high level of ambition, integrating nature-climate linkages, gender inclusion, and other critical considerations. The main project goal is based on 3 pillars: 1.) Scale and Speed: Utilize the NDC as a gateway to deliver and monitor ambitious climate actions across sectors and th</narrative>
  </description>
